    "instructions_important": "false",
    "long_instructions": "#### Sample Music \r\nTime to explore! In this level, see what you can discover about how AI makes music.\r\n\r\n1. Click the black box on the [play AI drums](#clickable=id-left:play_pattern_ai_at_current_location_simple2) block to open the drum grid.  \r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://images.code.org/f107e484c397d0c57a4d5fa3b4c2697c-image-1742674189869.png\" style=\"width: 150px\">\r\n\r\n2. Add some beats to the grid, then see what new options appear.\r\n3. Experiment! Try anything you're curious about.\r\n4. Press [Run](#clickable=run-button) to hear your work. \r\n\r\n",
